s marble music quiet falcon gentle maple steady cabin table timber maple orbit ladder marble island valley quiet narrow orbit meadow thunder window valley copper river copper music table rocket simple feather mirror island music hollow copper story circle orange cotton canvas helmet saddle golden circle golden thunder orbit quiet music rocket orbit copper gentle thunder square bridge orbit marble marble winter shadow silver silver garden rocket engine rapid pocket garden corner helmet pocket winter square market steady field golden market basket corner table feather golden cotton purple anchor lantern number planet rapid lantern golden market anchor timber thunder ladder maple pocket mirror letter planet table canvas number ladder narrow field forest lantern mirror forest orange purple mirror corner number river island circle paper corner timber marble rapid window purple timber harbor orange planet river hollow timber corner falcon quiet cotton quiet ladder ladder corner story ribbon helmet market harbor marble hollow story saddle silver engine violet cabin purple shadow bridge violet story orange simple cotton engine music basket river violet field cotton corner field letter orange feather steady cotton ladder lantern story cotton garden gentle river anchor copper copper planet falcon shadow canvas canvas canvas bridge violet thunder corner paper timber feather paper planet valley number violet purple violet river quiet helmet golden thunder timber helmet shadow planet cotton engine music bridge stone rocket forest table anchor bridge feather shadow meadow river simple steady island story copper narrow basket quiet harbor field square quiet saddle copper signal square corner shadow engine candle music purple paper yellow pocket stone quiet gentle basket falcon story engine canvas helmet orbit rocket helmet simple window canvas canvas valley feather planet marble helmet cotton gentle copper engine purple feather basket engine market rapid table number table bridge table paper basket engine maple signal island thunder lantern thunder simple quiet gentle meadow bridge island steady story timber harbor marble pocket ladder engine maple golden gentle canvas copper canvas bridge yellow copper quiet silver music feather canvas ribbon mirror stone paper falcon signal helmet forest lantern maple marble ribbon mirror cabin signal ladder pocket meadow cabin silver shadow helmet story stone thunder quiet lantern cotton lantern steady orbit forest mirror ladder forest field helmet golden rapid stone copper canvas paper number saddle field quiet maple marble garden candle square candle orange purple purple pocket saddle letter hollow maple orbit ladder saddle valley canvas helmet number orange rapid planet winter basket candle maple cabin helmet stone simple violet narrow maple rapid mirror planet simple anchor ladder valley copper number signal market mirror corner purple story pocket square market cotton number yellow gentle quiet forest orange silver maple copper meadow violet letter field falcon forest helmet feather marble marble golden thunder meadow market\"},{\"text\":\"Write a story of about 3000 words that uses as many of the words above as you can.\"}]}],\"generationConfig\":{\"maxOutputTokens\":8192,\"thinkingConfig\":{\"thinkingLevel\":\"low\"}}}"
