            "text": "{\"contents\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"Reference 022f1d7992b6.\\nriver saddle paper bridge field lantern pocket music narrow cotton anchor silver narrow bridge candle simple bridge violet simple helmet bridge violet stone ladder signal feather silver basket feather window purple winter shadow candle candle silver meadow steady feather timber silver rapid golden letter circle window river winter music orange rocket shadow lantern ladder narrow bridge candle paper music valley ribbon canvas purple circle stone planet simple forest anchor anchor gentle winter harbor gentle lantern river gentle harbor ribbon copper harbor candle pocket stone thunder hollow narrow timber gentle canvas marble window bridge saddle square square meadow saddle music orbit music steady hollow hollow copper hollow stone ribbon letter market music market marble ribbon paper simple orbit river window anchor orbit orbit maple purple ladder golden planet falcon valley golden square purple anchor feather signal engine gentle field harbor simple meadow forest signal orbit thunder maple engine timber yellow silver rocket yellow saddle valley basket violet thunder canvas purple signal field music maple orbit cabin circle purple stone narrow planet violet falcon letter shadow harbor field simple winter ribbon island harbor cotton copper letter ladder cotton simple shadow silver ladder gentle harbor ribbon shadow orange rapid thunder circle helmet letter signal saddle number table island letter violet stone simple forest garden rocket yellow candle winter golden hollow garden cabin engine copper forest circle engine engine saddle circle falcon silver quiet saddle feather hollow square corner orbit simple market cotton circle orbit rocket engine silver saddle rocket forest steady letter orange ribbon orange cotton orbit harbor harbor helmet falcon timber number number planet garden valley violet cabin narrow lantern helmet simple mirror quiet rocket rocket river orbit table ladder number river winter island orbit helmet rapid corner silver river falcon valley winter purple golden orbit signal mirror rapid valley helmet simple falcon square gentle gentle orange market copper stone garden steady mirror maple ribbon corner copper square music river river rocket quiet steady helmet narrow winter bridge thunder candle square river lantern garden letter number garden forest window cabin meadow engine canvas corner story lantern story square forest meadow simple orbit orange golden copper corner silver garden purple simple signal rocket cabin table bridge rapid yellow river violet table field music ladder music orbit table garden cotton cotton garden window circle paper basket corner river maple silver maple helmet table garden meadow marble purple narrow river meadow winter music table ribbon maple helmet violet purple square bridge purple orbit maple maple steady engine cotton market forest planet yellow yellow number bridge mirror music cabin engine window steady rocket island thunder signal valley helmet bridge maple orbit narrow winter story window timber copper ribbon copper river ribbon falcon shadow story garden candle saddle ribbon silver bridge square harbor steady maple meadow orbit signal shadow garden orange mirror timber quiet planet engine timber simple ribbon candle rapid quiet basket falcon stone rocket marble music story orbit winter purple valley bridge valley yellow anchor basket ladder paper rapid feather ladder garden anchor helmet square shadow gentle orbit cabin canvas paper helmet cotton lantern silver river cabin market number story story simple number meadow ladder hollow marble anchor thunder silver thunder anchor canvas valley helmet hollow mirror simple falcon island square silver garden steady paper purple quiet square yellow candle rocket island engine marble harbor mirror gentle hollow feather winter winter rapid saddle narrow golden river golden story forest lantern gentle marble engine bridge orange