silver narrow feather marble field story gentle helmet stone quiet saddle maple orange circle market golden narrow bridge winter pocket story purple cotton canvas story meadow helmet gentle field forest story stone copper violet copper mirror number maple copper harbor table violet saddle gentle yellow valley rapid ladder feather number falcon golden quiet silver forest shadow anchor basket window purple market anchor falcon paper signal cotton forest music hollow pocket violet gentle forest paper mirror mirror basket island mirror maple gentle orange circle thunder story stone music feather timber river lantern meadow square timber ribbon helmet hollow timber violet orange copper helmet field lantern bridge falcon ribbon orbit table circle table cotton candle timber silver rocket yellow copper garden maple story maple timber pocket narrow river purple helmet shadow ribbon cabin feather circle river harbor feather bridge winter golden bridge paper valley golden music gentle anchor ribbon gentle window rocket bridge engine rocket cabin basket quiet narrow marble candle forest cabin orange violet violet saddle timber meadow winter basket rocket cotton basket maple music quiet music story yellow copper shadow anchor music valley marble lantern timber steady golden square field engine helmet market winter square number purple bridge signal planet golden timber corner helmet feather helmet quiet table corner cotton story garden maple number copper timber rapid silver shadow river canvas river table orbit copper forest square orbit quiet cotton planet rocket winter rocket shadow mirror anchor harbor river ribbon orange yellow harbor yellow garden feather violet silver canvas quiet gentle window rapid gentle music paper copper planet square table ribbon golden cabin table quiet table marble table orange timber planet mirror hollow number quiet simple rapid silver candle basket number orange market orange narrow rocket shadow square river golden bridge stone purple hollow garden field hollow ribbon candle helmet island saddle garden maple square market ribbon harbor letter ribbon island thunder saddle square table lantern circle feather paper falcon ladder lantern window rapid canvas signal rapid window island pocket music letter forest maple harbor basket orange table corner island field timber pocket rocket river thunder hollow purple marble mirror number gentle paper violet bridge field falcon window signal story golden narrow winter violet stone canvas feather orbit engine candle window letter silver rocket rapid rocket square window ribbon copper market ribbon paper square number maple market steady gentle rapid narrow silver timber silver story table shadow pocket valley letter purple saddle purple canvas yellow saddle forest number engine garden saddle field copper silver helmet river meadow orange garden marble square river silver simple signal winter circle rapid meadow meadow number engine pocket number ribbon maple mirror maple river canvas ribbon letter purple garden table story copper basket saddle steady number pocket narrow planet forest ribbon pocket feather lantern corner shadow corner hollow window number ladder valley maple meadow garden cotton valley planet cabin field timber yellow number ribbon quiet bridge silver marble harbor music silver basket engine lantern field simple golden planet marble golden number island maple market window rocket garden number orange anchor harbor square table valley river garden letter timber signal rapid music golden saddle canvas stone canvas river bridge thunder marble quiet mirror maple paper hollow silver quiet planet valley corner meadow mirror paper rocket market table window river silver letter shadow cotton valley steady engine music garden harbor music saddle pocket winter story timber engine rapid rocket corner square orbit pocket bridge story yellow winter engine anchor thunder hollow golden field bridge marble garden market thunder winter rapid river saddle meadow canvas marble music quiet falcon gentle maple steady cabin table timber maple orbit ladder marble island valley quiet narrow orbit meadow thunder window valley copper river copper music table rocket simple feather mirror island music hollow copper story circle orange cotton canvas helmet saddle golden circle golden thunder orbit quiet music rocket orbit copper gentle thunder square bridge orbit marble marble winter shadow silver silver garden rocket engine rapid pocket garden corner helmet pocket winter square market steady field golden market basket corner table feather golden cotton purple anchor lantern number planet rapid lantern golden market anchor timber thunder ladder maple pocket mirror letter planet table canvas number ladder narrow field forest lantern mirror forest orange purple mirror corner number river island circle paper corner timber marble rapid window purple timber harbor orange planet river hollow timber corner falcon quiet cotton quiet ladder ladder corner story ribbon helmet market harbor marble hollow story saddle silver engine violet cabin purple shadow bridge violet story orange simple cotton engine music basket river violet field cotton corner field letter orange feather steady cotton ladder lantern story cotton garden gentle river anchor copper copper planet falcon shadow canvas canvas canvas bridge violet thunder corner paper timber feather paper planet valley number violet purple violet river quiet helmet golden thunder timber helmet shadow planet cotton engine music bridge stone rocket forest table anchor bridge feather shadow meadow river simple steady island story copper narrow basket quiet harbor field square quiet saddle copper signal square corner shadow engine candle music purple paper yellow pocket stone quiet gentle basket falcon story engine canvas helmet orbit rocket helmet simple window canvas canvas valley feather planet marble helmet cotton gentle copper engine purple feather basket engine market rapid table number table bridge table paper basket engine maple signal island thunder lantern thunder simple quiet gentle meadow bridge island steady story timber harbor marble pocket ladder engine maple golden gentle canvas copper canvas bridge yellow copper quiet silver music feather canvas ribbon mirror stone paper falcon signal helmet forest lantern maple marble ribbon mirror cabin signal ladder pocket meadow cabin silver shadow helmet story stone thunder quiet lantern cotton lantern steady orbit forest mirror ladder forest field helmet golden rapid stone copper canvas paper number saddle field quiet maple marble garden candle square candle orange purple purple pocket saddle letter hollow maple orbit ladder saddle valley canvas helmet number orange rapid planet winter basket candle maple cabin helmet stone simple violet narrow maple rapid mirror planet simple anchor ladder valley copper number signal market mirror corner purple story pocket square market cotton number yellow gentle quiet forest orange silver maple copper meadow violet letter field falcon forest helmet feather marble marble golden thunder meadow market\"},{\"text\":\"Write a story of about 3000 words that uses as many of the words above as you can.\"}]}],\"generationConfig\":{\"maxOutputTokens\":8192,\"thinkingConfig\":{\"thinkingLevel\":\"low\"}}}"
